[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3774770375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114275#issuecomment-3774770375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114275","id":3774770375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7g_mzH","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T20:19:58Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T20:19:58Z","body":"This happens because the signal for `EditorSpinSlider` losing focus (and therefore changing the value) is fired _after_ the input to change the inspector data, which happens here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_set_atlas_source_editor.cpp#L1511-L1529\n\nThe problem is that the object that the inspector edits is constant, with only its data being modified when a new tile is selected, as opposed to an object being replaced that could still be interacted with.\n\nTo solve this, either the data change is deferred, or `EditorSpinSlider` is modified to update its value sooner. @KoBeWi Suggestions?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3774770375/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778226027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114275#issuecomment-3778226027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114275","id":3778226027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hMydr","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T13:47:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T13:48:13Z","body":"Deferring does not fix it.\nCan't think of any fix it that isn't a hack. Maybe a method that forces the inspector to commit any edited values, but not sure if it's possible/feasible.\n\nAs for hacks, either the tile change can be extra deferred with a timer/`idle_process` signal, or modifying the value can be blocked for one frame after changing tile.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3778226027/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]